roundedT -- forms step 9 (Tony, 2026-11-11, SEQ 621): rounded on the fill and border floor methods. rounded is the corner
radius in points, on a field or its style; a bare rounded takes defaultStyle's (5, IncantForms/Controls/styles). Rows are in
genLadder/formsPop.sh. Each corner row is paired with a painted pixel of the same field, so an undrawn field cannot pass. Pixels on a curve are
anti-aliased, so the harness reads each pixel as a class (white, red, blue, green, clear), never as an exact value there.
RD-8 draws IncantForms/Windows/simple to IncantForms/PDF/test.pdf and reads it back.
